        <source>Click the button below to initialize the Property and Broker objects with sample data. All existing records in these objects will be deleted.</source>
        <target state="translated">请单击下面的按钮，使用示例数据初始化“房产”和“经纪人”对象。这些对象中的所有现有记录都将被删除。</target>
        <note from="developer" annotates="general">Click the button below to initialize the Property and Broker objects with sample data. All existing records in these objects will be deleted.</note>
